# Test of the Duelist (Q222), a second class-change test for fighters, played by a level 39
# Warrior who already holds eight of each trophy of the first part and one of each of the second
# (the kills below bring each list to its count): Kaien starts it, gives the five orders and
# pays the level 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds (72 for a Warrior, once per character); ten of
# each of ten trophies bring cond 3, Kaien takes them for the final order; three of each of five
# stronger trophies bring cond 5, and Kaien gives the Mark of Duelist; then relog. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
